{"source": "Brihat Jataka (Varaha Mihira)", "reference": "Ch. 4 v. 1", "text": "The menses that appear monthly, because of Mars and the Moon (a) (bring about conception) when the Moon is in one of the Anunpachaya signs(/>). If the Moon be otherwise (i*) and be aspected by a benefio male planet(d)j there will be sexual union between a woman and her husband."}
